en.howTo:
Your invite code: {{code}}

On your phone, open this link with Grindylocks installed: {{link}}
Or open Grindylocks, tap "I have an invite code" and type the code. Sign in with this email address ({{email}}). Already on Grindylocks? Sign in with this address and the invite is waiting under the bell.

The invite works once and expires on {{expires}}.

